{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780320/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.webp?t=1750874625\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780320/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webp?t=1750874625\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET BONNIE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonnie\u2014the bold-hearted rogue, who's passion is risk, her life is pure motion. Bonnie isn't just chasing adventure\u2014she is the adventure: with a raspy laugh, a daring stare, and a hunger to grab life (and you) by its most precious parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's a born thrill-seeker. Gold, brawls, narrow escapes... and quick, no-strings-attached sex. On a rooftop, in a basement, in the saddle\u2014any surface will do when it's time to blow off steam and gear up for the next wild ride. Her signature style? Handcuffs stolen from the city guard, and a gag lifted straight from a Naama lust dungeon. Bonnie will ride you\u2014literally and figuratively\u2014and she'll expect you to be ready to run off with her at a moment's notice, whether that means chasing treasure... or fleeing the guards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780320/extras/divider.png?t=1750874625\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Bonnie as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><